    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Zuido\u3011-An artificial passageway built underground, which refers to a tunnel or hakamichi (a road leading to a grave).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a horror walking simulator that only takes you through tunnels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You visit the tunnels to shoot a psychic video,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more bizarre sounds begin to echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you captured through the camera was an eerie figure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - 20 min. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra (Zuido8)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must try to escape from the endless tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. do not miss any anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. if you find something unusual, go right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. if you do not find anything unusual, go left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. exit tunnel 8 safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once discovered, anomalies will not reappear until all are discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may distribute your video without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible only when you use the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video and distribution, and a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Zuido\u3011-An artificial passageway built underground, which refers to a tunnel or hakamichi (a road leading to a grave).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a horror walking simulator that only takes you through tunnels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You visit the tunnels to shoot a psychic video,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more bizarre sounds begin to echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you captured through the camera was an eerie figure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - 20 min. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra (Zuido8)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must try to escape from the endless tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. do not miss any anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. if you find something unusual, go right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. if you do not find anything unusual, go left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. exit tunnel 8 safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once discovered, anomalies will not reappear until all are discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may distribute your video without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible only when you use the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video and distribution, and a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p>",
